    "name": "Spirit Swap: Lofi Beats to Match-3 To",
    "steam_appid": 1592170,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/33bdf3a3e904a77383c19d494db4934e.avif?t=1754057708\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/6eba75d10a59c9df7c7367dbac2341de.poster.avif?t=1754057708\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/6eba75d10a59c9df7c7367dbac2341de.webm?t=1754057708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/6eba75d10a59c9df7c7367dbac2341de.mp4?t=1754057708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Samar is a young witch who works the spirit-swapping night shift in the eastern outskirts of Demashq. A recent spike in spirits crossing over from another dimension within the borders of the city has them puzzling over what\u2019s going on.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With friends needing help - and a popular band scheduled to kick off their big comeback tour in Demashq - Samar needs to work quickly before the city is overrun with stans and spirits alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/e36011c7c028dcedfe345279550e710f.poster.avif?t=1754057708\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/e36011c7c028dcedfe345279550e710f.webm?t=1754057708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/e36011c7c028dcedfe345279550e710f.mp4?t=1754057708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Spirit Swap: Lofi Beats to Match-3 To blends two major sources of inspiration: the joyful, colorful puzzle mechanics of Panel de Pon and the heartfelt and playful storytelling of visual novels/dating sims.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/244814061200996c9a2ba3759f006c83.avif?t=1754057708\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Swap to a custom lofi soundtrack</strong> by the incredible Meltycanon.\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cast powerful spells</strong> by arranging spirits into special patterns to unlock potent powers.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bond with a diverse cast of witches and demons</strong>\u2026 and maybe even smooch.\u00a0\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decorate your bedroom.</strong> Earn trinkets and keepsakes as you play, then place them to decorate Samar\u2019s room.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enjoy unique game modes</strong>, including Endless and local Versus!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/9c43333b48b2c153301fdd6e98315951.poster.avif?t=1754057708\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/9c43333b48b2c153301fdd6e98315951.webm?t=1754057708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/9c43333b48b2c153301fdd6e98315951.mp4?t=1754057708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/33bdf3a3e904a77383c19d494db4934e.avif?t=1754057708\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/6eba75d10a59c9df7c7367dbac2341de.poster.avif?t=1754057708\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/6eba75d10a59c9df7c7367dbac2341de.webm?t=1754057708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/6eba75d10a59c9df7c7367dbac2341de.mp4?t=1754057708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Samar is a young witch who works the spirit-swapping night shift in the eastern outskirts of Demashq. A recent spike in spirits crossing over from another dimension within the borders of the city has them puzzling over what\u2019s going on.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With friends needing help - and a popular band scheduled to kick off their big comeback tour in Demashq - Samar needs to work quickly before the city is overrun with stans and spirits alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/e36011c7c028dcedfe345279550e710f.poster.avif?t=1754057708\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/e36011c7c028dcedfe345279550e710f.webm?t=1754057708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/e36011c7c028dcedfe345279550e710f.mp4?t=1754057708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Spirit Swap: Lofi Beats to Match-3 To blends two major sources of inspiration: the joyful, colorful puzzle mechanics of Panel de Pon and the heartfelt and playful storytelling of visual novels/dating sims.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/244814061200996c9a2ba3759f006c83.avif?t=1754057708\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Swap to a custom lofi soundtrack</strong> by the incredible Meltycanon.\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cast powerful spells</strong> by arranging spirits into special patterns to unlock potent powers.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bond with a diverse cast of witches and demons</strong>\u2026 and maybe even smooch.\u00a0\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decorate your bedroom.</strong> Earn trinkets and keepsakes as you play, then place them to decorate Samar\u2019s room.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enjoy unique game modes</strong>, including Endless and local Versus!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/9c43333b48b2c153301fdd6e98315951.poster.avif?t=1754057708\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/9c43333b48b2c153301fdd6e98315951.webm?t=1754057708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592170/extras/9c43333b48b2c153301fdd6e98315951.mp4?t=1754057708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Cast spells, be queer, and crash the biggest concert of the year! Spirit Swap is an action-puzzle meets narrative game set in a lush world of witchy demons.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201c...the game has managed to take my love for puzzle games and turn them into something magically creative.  And gay.  Very, very gay.\u201d<br>The Mary Sue<br><br>\u201cSpirit Swap juxtaposes the relaxation we associate with lo-fi music with a demanding competitive streak.\u201d<br>Fanbyte<br><br>\u201cSpirit Swap looks to be giving the match-three genre a much-needed fresh lick of paint.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br>",
